    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτύφομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, 
			Pass.
		, aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ετύφην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Lys.</u>
			221
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be burnt
